OL,3,GNEWSACommunity-owned distillery calls
OL,4,Ain administrators
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operators of a community-owned
OL,7,Fdistillery in the Highlands have called
OL,8,Fin administrators due to "commercial
OL,9,Fand legal challenges" and costs.
OL,11,FGlenWyvis Distillery Ltd, near
OL,12,FDingwall, was launched in 2015 with the
OL,13,Fsupport of 3,000 investors, and it
OL,14,Freleased its first whisky in 2021.
OL,16,FAlistair McAlinden and Geoff Jacobs, of
OL,17,FInterpath Advisory, have been appointed
OL,18,Fas joint administrators.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
